      "id": "yunus-and-the-whale",
      "title": {
        "en": "Yunus and the Whale",
        "ar": "يونس والحوت",
        "fr": "Yunus et la baleine"
      },
      "summary": {
        "en": "A prophet leaves his people in anger, is swallowed by the sea, and finds that no darkness is beyond the reach of du’a.",
        "ar": "نبيٌّ يترك قومه غاضباً، فيبتلعه البحر، ويعلم أن لا ظلمة تعلو على الدعاء.",
        "fr": "Un prophète quitte son peuple en colère, est englouti par la mer, et découvre qu’aucune obscurité n’est hors de portée de l’invocation."
      },
      "cover": "sea-night",
      "series": "prophets",
      "sources": [
        "Quran 37:139-148",
        "Quran 21:87-88",
